{"name": "Parry the Bullet", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced, bullet-parrying top-down action. One-hit kills, short intense levels, challenges, and a style system.  You play as a chicken knight in a medieval bird kingdom. Firearms have appeared out of nowhere. The crows used them to plunge the kingdom into chaos. You must stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/75f675295e59e12b2f5a94d67d8b8445.avif?t=1783001374\" width=\"1170\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/0d9d1f9467ddeb564afd6b97ca23fc0b.poster.avif?t=1783001374\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/0d9d1f9467ddeb564afd6b97ca23fc0b.webm?t=1783001374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/0d9d1f9467ddeb564afd6b97ca23fc0b.mp4?t=1783001374\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parry bullets, slash, shoot, throw, execute. Turn enemy weapons against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/34fdffeb3e011d5599cf3dd967570d94.avif?t=1783001374\" width=\"1170\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/bf058e3428f7fb2415c06e38803d6507.poster.avif?t=1783001374\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/bf058e3428f7fb2415c06e38803d6507.webm?t=1783001374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/bf058e3428f7fb2415c06e38803d6507.mp4?t=1783001374\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill enemies with style. Complex kills earn more points and build your style rank faster. Can you reach S-rank?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/47f8f58e8122264c3918530106183890.avif?t=1783001374\" width=\"1170\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/a38a750e3c322e9e87f5023bddee519c.poster.avif?t=1783001374\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/a38a750e3c322e9e87f5023bddee519c.webm?t=1783001374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/a38a750e3c322e9e87f5023bddee519c.mp4?t=1783001374\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylish kills make you faster. Higher your style rank, faster you move. How fast can you clear the arena?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/extras/62686713fcb2a6f198fece2d7dbbb2f7.avif?t=1783001374\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">45 levels with challenges and S-ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 hour high-intensity campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 different biomes with unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 weapons to master and combine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by Hotline Miami, Katana ZERO, Ghostrunner, and I Am Your Beast.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Kill fast. Die fast. Parry, slash and shoot your way through an army of gunslinger knights in this fast-paced top-down action. Master stylish kills and fuel your speed with blood. A short and intense challenge.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640140/5007c024748fcdd1607f77fdc160ee725729ad16/header.jpg?t=1783001374", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Violent", "Top-Down", "Action", "Fast-Paced", "Top-Down Shooter", "Gore"], "developers": "hogon2099", "publishers": "hogon2099", "release_date": "November 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4640140", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "2 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/jLq-Fzl_FIg", "first_seen": 1782943200.0, "review_rank": 355}